ater you can see the bottom of. Reached on foot across the scrub.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":12,"urls":["https://www.charmingsardinia.com/sardinia/arcipelago-della-maddalena.html","https://strictlysardinia.com/best-boat-trips-to-la-maddalena/","https://dianabancale.com/the-best-boat-tours-in-the-archipelago-of-la-maddalena-sardinia-2024/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Spiaggia Rosa on Budelli","type":"activity","detail":"The pink beach, coloured by crushed coral. Landing has long been banned, so it is looked at from the water.","season":[5,6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":12,"urls":["https://www.viator.com/tours/Sardinia/La-Maddalena-Archipelago-and-Caprera-Maxi-boat-tour-from-Palau/d24293-92232P6","https://www.charmingsardinia.com/sardinia/arcipelago-della-maddalena.html","https://www.natoursardinia.com/eng/full-day-boat-tour-la-maddalena/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Snorkel and dive the park","type":"activity","detail":"Protected water, granite drop offs and good visibility; dive centres run out of La Maddalena town.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":12,"urls":["https://www.voyagetips.com/en/la-maddalena/","https://www.charmingsardinia.com/sardinia/arcipelago-della-maddalena.html","https://strictlysardinia.com/la-maddalena-sardinia/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk the island forts","type":"trail","detail":"Old military batteries are scattered over both islands, linked by dirt tracks with the whole strait in view.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":12,"urls":["https://www.voyagetips.com/en/la-maddalena/","https://strictlysardinia.com/la-maddalena-sardinia/","https://strictlysardinia.com/best-boat-trips-to-la-maddalena/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"La Maddalena town","type":"activity","detail":"Cobbled lanes behind the waterfront, Piazza Garibaldi with its cafes and old navy buildings, and the parish church of Santa Maria Maddalena.","evidence":{"n_sourc